# The root .dockerignore excludes bin/, which is exactly what this
# image needs to copy. Excluding everything and re-admitting the two
# paths also keeps the build context to the binary alone rather than
# the whole tree, vendor/ included.
#
# Buildkit picks up the <containerfile>.dockerignore convention
# automatically; podman does not, so Makefile.local-dev passes
# --ignorefile explicitly.
*
!bin/manager
!LICENSE
